     201.  00:5F23                      ;FILVRM_RAM:																; BIOS: 56h
     202.  00:5F23                      																		; Function : Fill VRAM with value
     203.  00:5F23                      																		; Input    : A  - Data byte
     204.  00:5F23                      																		;            BC - Length of the area to be written
     205.  00:5F23                      																		;            HL - Start address
